: "trailer_cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1720590662348866", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298930_1720590665682199_6856877077492477682_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-zYAq3C4na0Q7kNvwFGXG3X&_nc_oc=AdoLd46zb_p89yyEfJtp-mVwHjJ8Vtf-sP_1cyJVbpDsOY3cjmcg4M3EFrM9_KPhRoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR8hGIdjNk6GMEX6uDyuQ2W2D-cWjp_m-8pbETBPzLYMQ&oe=6B0B0CB5"}, "display_name": "Cube Zen", "keywords": ["cube", "zen", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Cube Zen is a hand-tracking puzzle cube for Meta Quest. No controllers: you reach out, grab the cube with your real hand, turn it over, and twist any layer by sliding a sticker with your fingertip. The layer follows your finger and snaps when you let go. It stays in your hand even when tracking gets noisy, so you can focus on the puzzle, not the tech.\\n\\nFour ways to play:\\n\u2022 Dojo: bite-size lessons that teach you to solve the cube for the first time, with clear goals, on-cube arrows and a friendly mascot cheering you on.\\n\u2022 Sprint: timed solves with best times saved per cube size.\\n\u2022 Challenges: daily and curated puzzles such as patterns, short scrambles and move-limited solves, each with three stars to earn", "short_description": "Cube Zen turns your hands into the only controller you need. Reach out, pick up a twisty cube, and turn its layers with your fingertips: the layer follows your finger and snaps into place. Learn to solve it step by step in the Dojo, race your best times in Sprints, take on daily Challenges, or just relax with 2x2 to 5x5 cubes in Zen mode. Calm space, no controllers, no pressure. Earn stars, XP and streaks as you go."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://claude.ai/artifact/W8JKiqUjKJWxuBzRQCEeef", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Francisco Manuel Mier y Teran Almazan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http